<title>USA: CCC buys 9,690 tonnes U.S. corn for Angola, Kenya.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 9,690 tonnes U.S. corn for Angola, Kenya.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it had purchased a total of 9,690 tonnes of U.S. yellow corn from Cargill Inc for export to Angola and Kenya, May 5-31 delivery.</p>
<p>The corn was priced at $128.10 per tonne, FOB Reserve.</p>
<p>The purchase comprised 5,000 tonnes for Angola and 4,690 tonnes for Kenya, CCC said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
